  Results: 87.10% precision, 80.77% recall.
    F1 score improvement: up to 0.35 over existing techniques.
  Presented at NeurIPS 2024, Vancouver.
  Key insight: decomposing dataflow analysis into function-level summaries that LLM can reason about.
